{"id":"afb5c64438f478ef","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-filter7-measure-zero-ideal.md","title":"ZFC Filter7 Measure Zero Ideal","display":"df-zfc-filter7-measure-zero-ideal — ZFC Filter7 Measure Zero Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-filter7-measure-zero-ideal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-filter7-measure-zero-ideal"],"display":"df-zfc-filter7-measure-zero-ideal — ZFC Filter7 Measure Zero Ideal","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","[[58-df-powerset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-filter7-measure-zero-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-filter7-measure-zero-ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-filter7-measure-zero-ideal — ZFC Filter7 Measure Zero Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"58-df-powerset.md\">58-df-powerset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mu,\\mathcal I \\in V\">\\(X,\\mu,\\mathcal I \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7MeasureZeroIdeal}_S \\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7MeasureZeroIdeal}_S \\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter7\\text{-}measure\\text{-}zero\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter7MeasureZeroIdeal}_S(X,\\mu,\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu))\\land\\mathcal I=\\{A\\in\\mathcal P(X):\\exists N\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu)\\;(A\\subseteq N\\land\\mu(N)=0)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter7\\text{-}measure\\text{-}zero\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter7MeasureZeroIdeal}_S(X,\\mu,\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu))\\land\\mathcal I=\\{A\\in\\mathcal P(X):\\exists N\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu)\\;(A\\subseteq N\\land\\mu(N)=0)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The null ideal includes every subset of a measurable null set, so <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> is never applied directly to a nonmeasurable set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-powerset.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mu,\\mathcal I \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7MeasureZeroIdeal}_S \\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter7\\text{-}measure\\text{-}zero\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter7MeasureZeroIdeal}_S(X,\\mu,\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu))\\land\\mathcal I=\\{A\\in\\mathcal P(X):\\exists N\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu)\\;(A\\subseteq N\\land\\mu(N)=0)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false}],"bytes":987,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1920","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-filter7-measure-zero-ideal.md|58-df-zfc-filter7-measure-zero-ideal]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["ca832ed6bc22f728","2b6b1d9eb78a2714"]}